     "annotation_name": "Sherman Clock",
     "annotation": "Clocked character: runs both filters as clocked (switched-capacitor) stages, clock at 100 x cutoff, with a faint clock whine and staircase grain that grows at low cutoffs. Behavioural: clock ratio and feedthrough level are assumptions. Above about cutoff = engine rate / 100 the filter runs smooth. Reference mode runs at least 8x while it is on. Options: SMOOTH, CLOCK. Default: SMOOTH.",
     "hint": "Sherman Clock: Clocked character: runs both filters as clocked (switched-capacitor) stages, clock at 100 x cutoff, with a faint clock whine and staircase grain that grows at low cutoffs. Behavioural: clock ratio and feedthrough level are assumptions. Above about cutoff = engine rate / 100 the filter runs smooth. Reference mode runs at least 8x while it is on."
    }
